"Hi {donor_name},\n"
"\n"
"Your recurring donation of {amount} to {campaign_title} was renewed today.\n"
"\n"
"Reference: {reference}\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for your continued support.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks,\n"
"{organisation_name}"
msgstr ""

